2026-11-23T16:11:00.2074598Z [36;1m  fi[0m
2026-11-23T16:11:00.2074747Z [36;1m}[0m
2026-11-23T16:11:00.2074893Z [36;1m[0m
2026-11-23T16:11:00.2075109Z [36;1m# Set environment variables, handling those with default values[0m
